191
00:16:09,349 --> 00:16:12,374
Your assignment has four questions. One,

192
00:16:12,394 --> 00:16:17,095
the machine now sews two plies of fleece, 3 millimetres thick.

193
00:16:17,115 --> 00:16:22,805
Find the shaft angles where the needle enters and leaves the fabric and the

194
00:16:22,825 --> 00:16:24,708
feed margins at each end,

195
00:16:24,728 --> 00:16:29,809
compare them with 1.5 millimetres, and state the risk and a remedy.

196
00:16:30,209 --> 00:16:33,882
Two, increase the lower looper's swing to 30 degrees.

197
00:16:33,902 --> 00:16:37,297
Estimate the crank radius with the rough formula,

198
00:16:37,317 --> 00:16:41,757
find the exact value in Virtual lab 9-2, explain the difference,

199
00:16:41,777 --> 00:16:46,983
and check that the minimum transmission angle is still at least 40 degrees.

200
00:16:47,383 --> 00:16:50,519
Three, for fleece, find the wave height,

201
00:16:50,539 --> 00:16:56,359
the flat-edge ratio and the radius to set the differential slide block to.

202
00:16:56,379 --> 00:16:59,200
